<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27625" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δι-φῠής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>:
		neut. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διφυῆ,</span> also <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διφυᾶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>PA</u>
					669b18
				</span></i>
			 (s. v. l.):—<i>of double nature</i> or <i>form,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχιδνα μειξοπάρθενος δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.9
				</span></i>
			; of Centaurs, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1095
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecyd.
				50
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>; of Pan, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				408d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κέκροψ,</span> i. e. man and
			serpent, but expld. as <i>of double sex</i> (<i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>), or <i>of double race</i> (Egyptian and Greek), <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. Ἔρως</span>”
				<i>sexual intercourse,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>A.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>twofold, double,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόραι</span> Ion Lyr.<i><span class="en">
				16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφρύες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					491b14
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στῆθος διφυὲς μαστοῖς</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				493a12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῶν μυκτήρων δύναμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>PA</u>
					657a4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῦς,</span> of the biceps, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				13.13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SD</u>
					2.13
				</span></i>
			.</div>
